                                    + " has been remembered with cookie: "
                                    + rememberMe.getName()
                                    + " whose value is: "
                                    + rememberMe.getValue()
                                    + "<br/>");
        }

        response.getWriter().println("Weak Randomness Test java.util.Random.nextInt(int) executed");
