                                    + "BenchmarkTest02632"
                                    + "' in query string.");
            return;
        }

        String param =
                queryString.substring(
                        paramLoc
                                + paramval
                                        .length()); // 1st assume "BenchmarkTest02632" param is last
        // parameter in query string.
